    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3673669756960768
    m_Localized: On the beautiful underwater stage of the Little Mermaid, use bubbles
      and ocean currents to move forward while searching for hidden ingredients.
      Utilize the Little Mermaid's skills to stop enemies in their tracks and gather
      the bounty of the sea!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3673585254318080
